WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/drive-detail/SpeedHistogramChart.tsx — a single-series speed-bucket histogram.
    props: speedHistData: SpeedHistogramBucket[]  (range: string; pct: number) — already bucketed + Math.round-ed
           by the parent drive-detail hook (useDriveDetailData.ts); this component owns NO bucketing math.
    render: ChartContainer(title "Speed Histogram", aria "Speed-bucket distribution histogram", dataColumns
            [range "Speed range", pct "% of drive"], height 220) wrapping —
              speedHistData.length > 0
                ? Recharts <BarChart data={speedHistData}> with <CartesianGrid>, <XAxis dataKey="range">,
                  <YAxis>, <Tooltip ChartTooltip>, single <Bar dataKey="pct" fill="#a855f7"
                  name={`% ${t('driveDetail.ofDrive','of drive')}`} radius={[4,4,0,0]}>
                : empty overlay — lucide <Activity/> (opacity 20%) over <p>{t('driveDetail.noChartData',
                  'No telemetry data available')}</p>
    the component's ONLY data transform: data={speedHistData.map((b) => ({ range: b.range, pct: b.pct }))}.
  Data sources (prompt): useTranslation.  Shared components: @/components/charts, @/components/motion.  Maps: none.

